 "_doc": "Web Mercator world tiles as MapLibre defines them (512 px world at zoom 0; a level-L tile is 512*2^(zoom-L) px). tile(lng, lat, L): lat clamped to +-85.05112878, x = floor((lng+180)/360 * 2^L), y = floor((1 - ln((1+sin)/(1-sin))/(2*pi))/2 * 2^L), both clamped to [0, 2^L-1]. centre: lng = (x+0.5)/2^L*360-180, lat = atan(sinh(pi*(1-2*(y+0.5)/2^L))) in degrees, rounded to 5 decimals. Read by tests/ (SQL, migration 602) AND frontend/src (lib/mapCounts.ts) so the two formulas cannot drift. A centre round-trips to its own tile and to its parent at L-1.",
